    "description": "Auth-focused collection for the SentiqAI backend covering Week 6 deliverables: register, login (JWT auto-saved to the `authToken` collection variable), and protected endpoints called with that saved token.\n\nSetup:\n1. Import this collection into Postman.\n2. Set `baseUrl` (defaults to http://localhost:5000/api).\n3. Run \"Register User\" once, then \"Login User\" \u2014 its Tests script automatically saves the returned JWT into `authToken`.\n4. Run the protected requests below it; they send `Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}` automatically.\n5. \"Access Protected Route (No Token)\" and \"Login \u2014 Trigger Rate Limit\" demonstrate the 401 and 429 failure cases required for the Week 6 screenshots.",
